New: Local-smoothing GMG supports 2D periodic spherical shells with 90- and
180-degree opening angles, using deal.II 9.9 or greater. Adaptive refinement
keeps periodic partners at matching levels. Meshes that already have periodic
hanging nodes remain unsupported. Solver defaults are unchanged; select
block GMG and local smoothing explicitly.
<br>
(Francesco Radica, 2026/09/23)
